":\"d144\"},\"ref\":\"d144\",\"snippet\":\" ... Because in the face of a world that may not want to hear her, Xiomara refuses to be silent.\\n\\nI went into The Poet X blind. I had no idea about the story, just that the writing is in verse. The book has so much hype. Expectations were ... \",\"title\":\"https://thebookbloglife.com/blog/2021/03/07/the-poet-x-book-review-5-star-read/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d145\"},\"ref\":\"d145\",\"snippet\":\" ... The result is the rise of the Republic of Gilead, a totalitarian regime that enforces rigid social roles and enslaves the few remaining fertile women. Offred is one of these, a Handmaid bound to produce children for one of Gilead's commanders. Deprived of her husband, her child ... \",\"title\":\"https://cdhe.colorado.gov/banned-book-list\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d146\"},\"ref\":\"d146\",\"snippet\":\" ... Most notably, Alexander (True Blood, Succession), Gustaf (Westworld, Oppenheimer), and Bill (the It films, Barbarian) have acted in big projects—and come out to support each other.\\n\\nJane Fonda\\n\\nActor Henry Fonda had two children who went into show business: the late Peter Fonda and Jane Fonda. Jane ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.marieclaire.com/celebrity/celebrities-from-famous-families/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d147\"},\"ref\":\"d147\",\"snippet\":\" ... Texas Bluebonnet Award Nominee (2020), Jane Addams Children's Book Award for Older Children (2019), NAIBA Book of the Year for Middle Grade (2018), Goodreads Choice Award Nominee for Middle Grade & Children's (2018), NCTE Charlotte Huck Honor Book (2019) - Garvey's Choice by Nikki Grime